From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 18:38:06 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 263/399] Unified: only the active file in the history,
 properties folded away

The tree shows the history of the active file only (the others are in the
tabs under the view), unless the user chose otherwise. The detailed
properties are folded away under it and come with "Detailed Properties"
in the right-click menu (remembered). A tool's panel opening fits the
whole model in the view.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
